		{"id":"2db5d0c23ce3860b","type":"text","text":"Sent by Famis\n\nSent to Kalyth due to Famis believing Kalyth was worthy of her blessing","x":-1832,"y":-311,"width":525,"height":159,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"6a10ba227d87f83b","type":"text","text":"Famis saw a brief flicker of  Tal'krizzar, the Crimson Predator soul. The soul was of bloody crimson, a few moments after its death, his soul vanished. The Crimson Legion do not follow the same cycle as we do. Possible having their own plane where their soul resides.","x":-369,"y":195,"width":420,"height":171,"color":"#ffffff"},
