		{"id":"1643a1afefc1408d","type":"file","file":"PNG's/Famis.png","x":-257,"y":-283,"width":195,"height":314,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"f053e5c921039ef1","type":"text","text":"Gods are making their moves = Vindicta wanted to assemble the greatest celestials of the upper plains for a meeting (On the Ran'tal)\n\nMedicus promise to Kalyth \"Keep learning about Ran'tal and to keep my faith in Famis\"\n\n(The God's don't know anything on the Ran'tal or the Crimson Legion)","x":476,"y":-366,"width":450,"height":275,"color":"#484141"},
